{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>If one commit a breach of trust.</b> A matter that was concealed, from the root מעיל. The sense: when one sins against the holy things of HaShem, he shall bring a ram, which is worth silver shekels, the minimum of the plural being two."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "Reading תמעל as the lemma head from the verse (תִּמְעֹל מַעַל); the text as given begins with תמעל without the expected prefixed bet."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:40.503417511Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}